el=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206290\">その<ruby>油井<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたくさんの<ruby>原油<rp>(</rp><rt>げんゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>産出<rp>(</rp><rt>さんしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">油井生产了大量的原油。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">原理</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原理；理论；基本原则</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"138266\"><ruby>多数決<rp>(</rp><rt>たすうけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>原理<rp>(</rp><rt>げんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>民主主義<rp>(</rp><rt>みんしゅしゅぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>根本<rp>(</rp><rt>こんぽん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>原則<rp>(</rp><rt>げんそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多数决策原则是民主的基本原则。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">原料</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">原料</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">原</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言論</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんろん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">言论；发言；观点表述</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161486\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあらゆる<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>言論<rp>(</rp><rt>げんろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>賛成<rp>(</rp><rt>さんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我同意所有人的言论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゲーム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">游戏；比赛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164815\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にそのゲームをさせてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请让我玩这个游戏。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">個</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">个（小物件的计数词）；个（军事单位的计数词）；个人；一个人；年（年龄差的计数词）；学年（学年的计数词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222655\">この<ruby>懐中電灯<rp>(</rp><rt>かいちゅうでんとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は２<ruby>個<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>電池<rp>(</rp><rt>でんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这款电灯需要两台电池。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">児</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">孩子；小孩；少年；青少年；子女；儿女；孩子；年轻女子；少女；幼崽；幼兽；幼仔；分枝；衍生物；利息；孳息；（金融）新股；增发股；闲家；非庄家的玩家；年轻艺妓；雏妓；鸟蛋；卵；表示「……的人」的后缀（多用于年轻女性）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210178\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>母親<rp>(</rp><rt>ははおや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>甘<rp>(</rp><rt>あま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个小男孩向母亲抱怨。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">子</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">孩子；小孩；少年；青少年；子女；儿女；孩子；年轻女子；少女；幼崽；幼兽；幼仔；分枝；衍生物；利息；孳息；（金融）新股；增发股；闲家；非庄家的玩家；年轻艺妓；雏妓；鸟蛋；卵；表示「……的人」的后缀（多用于年轻女性）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198918\">なんてばかな<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なんだ、あいつは！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是多么愚蠢的孩子!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">户（计数词，用于计算房屋、住户、公寓等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225970\">きのうの<ruby>火事<rp>(</rp><rt>かじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で２００<ruby>戸<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>全焼<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">昨天的火灾造成200个房屋被烧毁。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">故</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">已故的；亡故的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恋爱；爱情</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204871\">それは<ruby>片思<rp>(</rp><rt>かたおも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いの<ruby>恋<rp>(</rp><rt>こい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个单心的爱情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">濃い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深色的；暗色的；浓厚；浓烈；浓稠；密集；可能性大；很可能；亲密；深厚；关系紧密</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224910\">コーヒーはどんなふうにしましょうか。<ruby>濃<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いブラックがいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如何喝咖啡?黑色好吃吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恋しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こいしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怀念的；渴望的；思念的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232859\">あなたはアメリカで<ruby>日本料理<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんりょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>恋<rp>(</rp><rt>こい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しくなるでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你会想念美国的日本美食。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恋する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こいする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">爱上；喜欢上；陷入爱河</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197700\">ピーターはその<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>恋<rp>(</rp><rt>こい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するようになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">彼得爱上了那个女孩。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/351239\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恋人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こいびと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">情人；恋人；男友；女友</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152266\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>恋人<rp>(</rp><rt>こいびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を「ダーリン」と<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我把我的情人称为“达林”。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">こう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这样；如此；这么；这么（多）；这样（多）；呃；嗯；唔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">校</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">学校；校对；样张</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">溝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">10的32次方；沟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">請う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">乞求；恳求；请求；邀请；祈祷；祈愿；希望</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121205\"><ruby>犯人<rp>(</rp><rt>はんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>裁判官<rp>(</rp><rt>さいばんかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>慈悲<rp>(</rp><rt>じひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>請<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">犯人向法官求怜&lt;unk&gt;。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">好意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">好意；善意；亲切；友好；好感；爱慕；喜爱；爱意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144609\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>好意<rp>(</rp><rt>こうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むのはいやだね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是的,你不能把它放在人的善意上。</span></div></li>"]